WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes. That's how long the audio session lasts.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The seller compares that time with an hour of advanced meditation.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
But a comparison is a claim, not a clock measurement.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Research into brainwave audio has mixed results. It did not test this product.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Short audio may be convenient. Convenience isn't proof of a medical or neurological effect.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the evidence. Try a free practice. Decide for yourself.
